0", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SCREENSHOTS_2560X1440 (2).png", "id": "1486514619106720", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822034_1486514622440053_5350027703891700155_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oNZQyiz-cv8Q7kNvwHxve09&_nc_oc=AdlnlWS4eThUXMGckPDipX1ZNixT2bLMPbuhZ7E069UW7iymBN5Vpp3M-w4vse9frCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuiP3ReWYCUsx2yBY7aipGRBmQ3OmchCIuoP4pXNFk1ew&oe=699C4C62"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOTS_2560X1440 (5).png", "id": "1919888858562570", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303672_1919888861895903_5807583194966335422_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xt7sGWUuKwUQ7kNvwHrrDJU&_nc_oc=Adm5hMA0xZ4MPuee6ALCR1SGtbqgSRZjMY-gr54u72va_hlWQzb28Q3FHTdbuBklseg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsjDn-DU-Vj0U2UFldXEO-WEyPj3RXsp6EUHaP9ywDV-A&oe=699C49D4"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOTS_2560X1440 (4).png", "id": "1359235385743992", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1359235389077325_4368325901624740377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-Tb6sQpf7aEQ7kNvwFvZUnt&_nc_oc=Adm2UhAXVHxeAs1n-7gLlyVwWq9Df-7IcjRp6fifKuHxS1zVN2bomxTcV0wpXE52PNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftPHHQuMZcgOAdkWVK1LsaJL8LYzqWEsDM_179QzTcc7Q&oe=699C3841"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOTS_2560X1440.png", "id": "872876032103081", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304162_872876035436414_3020336656496025126_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P3hKDUMLWNoQ7kNvwHmBG-5&_nc_oc=AdlY7GurX-0-vd9FrvEgpsQq9hg0bWoB0EjjQTmZTcSFYTMBZLtr50ZaL4MqmIS3WRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7PcYkcJMviBt2l4H6pWpVb3xN1BWNfd-bnU7cQXjKRg&oe=699C58E5"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOTS_2560X1440 (6).png", "id": "1187804583541941", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499309014_1187804586875274_7643194573505783707_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DWgYEMi2PEAQ7kNvwHA0bZX&_nc_oc=AdmxNpegjsR9lr2QbT70t7qieif2kdQG1JZbVc2NRNfH-lbINRyt9NGoggMkdzaH0Ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuaBp-JiCxAsoYxloT7byRzU_iP4CF9u8uxwfKUbjWcKg&oe=699C367C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LANDSCAPE_2560X1440.png", "id": "1216370043678552", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_1216370047011885_2368225615976167346_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RaTZQQRXhAkQ7kNvwExTym2&_nc_oc=Adn2uQVhJTBkuQR96-1RwD7aqatAHm376nV1PxsgXl7svYfbILkZ_-ZDaKjjmNhQnJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs03CZWWEicRA2encXd0dk1bxmyeMby7ny98azcluE4BQ&oe=699C4BB7"}, "display_name": "Cyberblade Battles", "keywords": ["competitive", "cyberpunk", "hangout", "multiplayer", "shooter"], "long_description": "# \u203b BECOME A CYBERBLADE RUNNER \u203b\n\nStep into the neon-lit world of Cyberblade Battles, the ultimate free-to-play VR co-op action shooter.\n\n\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\ufba9\u0668\u0640\n\n# **\u2694\ufe0f DYNAMIC COMBAT \u2694\ufe0f**\n\nMaster your combat rig\u2019s movement systems to dominate as a cyber-ninja with customizable weapons and cyberblades in physics-based combat.\n\n# **\ud83d\udca5 CHAOTIC PROCEDURAL RAIDS \ud83d\udca5**\n\nTeam up with friends (or go solo) to raid ever-changing procedural levels packed with drone swarms, traps, bonus loot rooms, and epic boss battles.\n\n# **\ud83d\udd25 LEVEL UP AND CUSTOMIZE \ud83d\udd25**\n\nEarn EXP to level up, loot cybercoins to upgrade and customize your combat rig, or just hang out at the rooftop skybar between runs.\n\n# **\u26a1 EVER-EVOLVING CONTENT \u26a1**\n\nRegular updates bring new maps, gear, and game modes. The city of Osyrys is always expanding, and new areas and secrets are constantly unlocked.\n\n# **\ud83c\udfaf FREE-TO-PLAY, SKILL-TO-WIN \ud83c\udfaf**\n\nDive straight into thrilling multiplayer raids. No pay-to-win. Just you and your skill.\n\n\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\ufba9\u0668\u0640\n\n# \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f COMING SOON \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\n\n- **\ud83d\udca3 INVENTORY CHAOS:** Grab, store, and deploy items mid-raid for chaos-inducing strategies.\n- **\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f CLANS:** Form, customize, and level up your squads to reach legendary status in the city of Osyrys.\n\n\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\u0640\ufba9\u0668\u0640\n\nJoin our community and find your squad: https://discord.gg/GEJ8VKrsNG", "short_description": "\u203bBECOME A CYBERBLADE RUNNER\u203b\n\nStep into the neon-lit world of Cyberblade Battles, the ultimate free-to-play VR co-op action shooter. Team up with friends (or go solo) to raid ever-changing procedural levels packed with drone swarms, traps, bonus loot rooms, and epic boss battles.\n\n- \u2694\ufe0f Dynamic combat with weapons and cyberblades\n- \ud83c\udf03 Chaotic procedural raids with friends\n- \ud83d\udd25 Level up and customize your combat rig\n- \ud83c\udfaf Free\u2011to\u2011play, skill\u2011to\u2011win\n\nJoin our community: https://discord.gg/GEJ8VKrsNG"}]}, "developer_name": "Osyrys", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.cyberbladebattles.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.cyberbladebattles.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "Osyrys", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/GEJ8VKrsNG", "website_url": "https://www.cyberbladebattles.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "271042753254130